      { term: "Accounting Standards Update (ASU)", definition: "The mechanism by which the FASB amends the Codification today – a transmittal document explaining and incorporating a change, rather than a freestanding new pronouncement." },
      { term: "EITF (Emerging Issues Task Force)", definition: "A FASB-affiliated group that historically reached 'consensus' positions on emerging accounting issues, incorporated into the Codification as part of its source material." },
